                                                        <li className="list-group-item bg-transparent border-0"><i className="icon icon-circle-check text-success me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Rich, highly interactive screens</li>
                                                        <li className="list-group-item bg-transparent border-0"><i className="icon icon-circle-check text-success me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Reusing components across a large app</li>
                                                        <li className="list-group-item bg-transparent border-0"><i className="icon icon-circle-check text-success me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Predictable state with hooks</li>
                                                        <li className="list-group-item bg-transparent border-0"><i className="icon icon-circle-check text-success me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Hiring from the widest front-end talent pool</li>
                                                    </ul>
