                                                        <li className="list-group-item bg-transparent border-0"><i className="icon icon-circle-minus text-danger me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>A bigger first download than plain JavaScript</li>
                                                        <li className="list-group-item bg-transparent border-0"><i className="icon icon-circle-minus text-danger me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>More to learn: JSX, hooks and rendering rules</li>
                                                        <li className="list-group-item bg-transparent border-0"><i className="icon icon-circle-minus text-danger me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>In-browser Babel is for teaching; use a build step in production</li>
